다만, 같은 그룹으로 등록하는 것과 두 곳에서 각각 픽업을 제공받는 것은 별개의 사항입니다. 현재 조직위원회에서는 공항 도착 시 별도의 픽업 서비스를 제공할 계획이 없으므로, 각 도착 장소에서 체크인 장소 및 숙소까지는 직접 이동해 주시기 바랍니다. 숙소에서 주요 행사장과 교리교육 장소 등으로 이동하실 때는 패키지에 포함된 교통카드를 이용해 대중교통 수단을 이용하실 수 있습니다.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q11' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
However, registering as the same group and being picked up at two different places are separate matters. The Local Organising Committee currently has no plans to provide a pick-up service on arrival at the airport, so please travel on your own from each arrival point to the check-in location and your accommodation. When travelling from your accommodation to the main event venues and catechesis locations, you can use public transport with the transport card included in your package.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q11' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
Sin embargo, inscribirse como un mismo grupo y ser recogidos en dos lugares distintos son cuestiones diferentes. Actualmente el Comité Organizador Local no tiene previsto ofrecer un servicio de recogida a la llegada al aeropuerto, por lo que les pedimos que se desplacen por su cuenta desde cada punto de llegada hasta el lugar de acreditación y el alojamiento. Para desplazarse desde el alojamiento hasta los principales lugares de los actos y de las catequesis, pueden usar el transporte público con la tarjeta de transporte incluida en el paquete.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q11' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
Cependant, s''inscrire comme un même groupe et être pris en charge à deux endroits différents sont deux questions distinctes. Le Comité d''organisation local ne prévoit pas actuellement de service d''accueil à l''arrivée à l''aéroport ; nous vous prions donc de vous rendre par vos propres moyens de chaque point d''arrivée jusqu''au lieu d''accréditation et à votre hébergement. Pour vous rendre de votre hébergement aux principaux lieux des célébrations et des catéchèses, vous pourrez utiliser les transports en commun avec la carte de transport incluse dans votre forfait.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q11' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
