국제 봉사자가 한국에서 장기간(3개월 이상) 활동하기 위해서는 비자 발급이 필수이며, 대부분 종교비자(D-6)를 발급받게 됩니다. 이미 비자를 소지하고 계신 경우에도 지원이 가능하며, 입국 과정이 훨씬 수월하다는 장점이 있습니다. 다만 비자를 소지하고 있더라도 국제 장기 봉사자 지원 절차는 동일하게 거쳐야 하며, 소속 교구 또는 주교회의의 추천서 제출을 동일하게 요청받을 수 있다는 점을 알아 두시기 바랍니다.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q40' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
International volunteers must obtain a visa to serve in Korea for a long period (three months or more), and most receive a religious visa (D-6). Those who already hold a visa can also apply, which has the advantage of making entry much easier. Please note, however, that even if you hold a visa, you must go through the same application procedure for international long-term volunteers and may likewise be asked to submit a letter of recommendation from your diocese or Bishops'' Conference.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q40' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
Para servir en Corea durante un periodo largo (tres meses o más), los voluntarios internacionales deben obtener un visado, y la mayoría recibe un visado religioso (D-6). Quienes ya tienen visado también pueden presentar su candidatura, lo que tiene la ventaja de facilitar mucho la entrada. No obstante, tengan en cuenta que, aunque tengan visado, deben seguir el mismo procedimiento de solicitud para voluntarios internacionales de larga duración y también se les puede pedir una carta de recomendación de su diócesis o Conferencia Episcopal.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q40' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
Pour servir en Corée sur une longue période (trois mois ou plus), les volontaires internationaux doivent obtenir un visa, et la plupart reçoivent un visa religieux (D-6). Ceux qui possèdent déjà un visa peuvent aussi postuler, ce qui facilite grandement l''entrée sur le territoire. Notez toutefois que, même avec un visa, il faut suivre la même procédure de candidature pour les volontaires internationaux de longue durée, et une lettre de recommandation de votre diocèse ou de votre Conférence épiscopale peut également vous être demandée.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q40' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
