교구대회 참가자가 서울조직위 주소로 비자 신청해도 되나요?', '한국 입국일은 교구대회 참가 여부와 관계없이 실제 항공편의 한국 도착일과 동일하게 기재해야 합니다. 또한 WYD에서 발급한 서류를 바탕으로 비자를 신청하므로, 신청 시에는 한국 내 주소와 연락처로 조직위원회 정보를 기재하는 것을 권장합니다. 다만 입국일과 출국일은 실제 항공편 일정과 동일하게 기재해야 합니다.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q103' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
Can participants in the Days in the Dioceses apply for a visa using the address of the Seoul Organising Committee?', 'The date of entry into Korea must be stated as the actual date of arrival in Korea on your flight, regardless of whether you take part in the Days in the Dioceses. Also, since visas are applied for on the basis of documents issued by WYD, we recommend entering the Local Organising Committee''s information as your address and contact details in Korea when applying. However, the dates of entry and departure must match your actual flight schedule.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q103' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
¿Pueden los participantes en los Días en las Diócesis solicitar el visado con la dirección del Comité Organizador de Seúl?', 'La fecha de entrada en Corea debe ser la fecha real de llegada a Corea según el vuelo, independientemente de que participen o no en los Días en las Diócesis. Además, como el visado se solicita con los documentos emitidos por la JMJ, recomendamos indicar los datos del Comité Organizador Local como dirección y contacto en Corea al hacer la solicitud. No obstante, las fechas de entrada y salida deben coincidir con el calendario real de los vuelos.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q103' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
Les participants aux Journées dans les diocèses peuvent-ils demander leur visa avec l''adresse du Comité d''organisation de Séoul ?', 'La date d''entrée en Corée doit correspondre à la date réelle d''arrivée en Corée selon votre vol, que vous participiez ou non aux Journées dans les diocèses. Par ailleurs, le visa étant demandé sur la base des documents délivrés par les JMJ, nous recommandons d''indiquer les coordonnées du Comité d''organisation local comme adresse et contact en Corée lors de la demande. Les dates d''entrée et de sortie doivent toutefois correspondre au calendrier réel de vos vols.' FROM qa_item WHERE question_no = 'Q103' ON CONFLICT (item_id, lang) DO UPDATE SET question = EXCLUDED.question, answer = EXCLUDED.answer, updated_at = now();
